{ Row displays of constants, which a68j makes tables (Tables, rt/Table:
  docs/optimizations.md, section 12): elements of every kind of mode, rows
  of two and three dimensions, constants mixed with other units (which are
  elaborated in their order), and a new row at each elaboration, which
  the program may change without changing the next one. }
